    ["“呜————”银制的哨子被吹响，像夜莺温柔的呢喃、像夏夜温煦的风。\n失控者停下攻击的动作，疯狂的眼眸中竟又凝起些许理智。\n他看到了所有的遗憾被弥补、所有的不堪被抹去、所有的悲伤还未涌起。他看到了另一种幸福的结局。\n做一场美梦吧，梦中的一切都还未堕落。\n永眠于美梦吧，把今生的痛苦就此掩埋。\n值夜者的猎魔子弹穿过了风，带走失控者的生命。异化后恐怖的身躯摇晃倒下，但是笑着的。\n“愿女神庇佑你。”队友收起枪祈祷，又摸了摸肩上亲昵落下的小鸟，“这件封印物真是无害，毕竟，谁会把这些鸟儿当做负面作用呢？”\n阿诺德拿出存放封印物的箱子，将夜莺银哨轻放了回去，妥帖地收在了身边。\n他身形挺拔、眼神坚定、笑声爽朗，像极了一个故人。\n“或许是因为，曾有一个温柔的灵魂栖息其中。”"] = "\"Woo—\" The silver whistle was blown, like the gentle murmur of a nightingale, like the warm breeze of a summer night. \nThe Out-of-Control Person stopped their attack, and a glimmer of reason actually condensed in their mad eyes. \nThey saw all regrets being mended, all ugliness being wiped away, and all sadness yet to arise. They saw another happy ending. \nHave a beautiful dream; in the dream, nothing has fallen yet. \nSleep forever in the beautiful dream, and bury the pain of this life here. \nThe Nighthawk's Demon Hunter Bullet passed through the wind, taking away the life of the Out-of-Control Person. The terrifying, mutated body swayed and fell, but it was smiling. \n\"May the Goddess protect you.\" The teammate put away the gun and prayed, then stroked the little bird that had affectionately landed on their shoulder. \"This Sealed Artifact is truly harmless; after all, who would consider these birds as a negative effect?\" \nArnold took out the box for storing Sealed Artifacts and gently placed the Nightingale Silver Whistle back, tucking it away securely. \nHis figure was upright, his eyes firm, and his laughter hearty, looking very much like an old friend. \n\"Perhaps it is because a gentle soul once resided within it.\"",
